 "purpose": "Typed array view (owner decision 2026-10-07). g++-16 only (clang 23 has no reflection). floats.cbor, 60000 binary64. One field = element 30000; every field = sum of all elements. MB_FIELD: path $.values[30000] from the root each time (today's per-access path). MB_READ_PATH: $.values[] with an index from the root for each element (per-access path). MB_READ: accessor of $.values, then @[] per element. MB_FIELD_VIEW / MB_READ_VIEW: view<$.values> checked once, then operator[]. FB_*: FlatBuffers without Verifier; FB_*_V: with VerifyFloatsBuffer each time. CP_*: Cap n Proto. aa2 = the same arm built a second time (A/A). Each arm its own binary, alternating in shuffled order, 10 rounds, min_time 0.2s. ns per message, real_time. FB_FIELD: the disassembly shows that the element load is removed by the compiler; only the vector offset is read.",
